# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Demo-only parity UI, with native rich-link fixtures from the isolated API branch.
# Soma Messages linked to the Mac's iMessage service (0.6+). Against the service's DEMO on the Mac Pro: sample
# chats only, nothing of Boss's; every send gets a fake reply 2 s later. The harness must inject its ephemeral port/token; the checked-in endpoint fails closed.
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key HOME
# A clean start: not linked yet, no contacts answer.
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
# Contacts allowed ahead, so Android's prompt (whose title also says Allow) doesn't cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
# 0.7+ asks for notifications when linked; granted here so its prompt does not cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO
# Quoted twice: walk.py hands the line to the phone's shell, which would split the link at '&'.
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A1&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
# The owner says yes to the Mac by name before anything goes to it.
expect Get your iMessages from 100.120.219.46?
shot link-dialog
tap Link
wait 1500
# Names come from the phone's contacts; the Mac's names stand in when the phone has none.
wait 4000
expect Weekend
expect Ana Demo
absent OpenBubbles
shot inbox-from-the-mac
hold Ana Demo
expect Mark unread
expect Pin
expect Mute
shot conversation-actions card=messages-parity-chat-actions
tap Pin
expect Pinned
shot pinned card=messages-parity-pinned-muted
hold Ana Demo
tap Mute
expect Muted
shot pinned-muted card=messages-parity-pinned-muted
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.messages
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
expect Pinned
expect Muted
shot preferences-after-restart card=messages-parity-pinned-muted
hold Ana Demo
tap Mark unread
expect Ana Demo, 1 unread
shot manually-unread card=messages-parity-list-read
tap Ana Demo
expect Perfect, see you there
absent Messages
doubletap Perfect, see you there
expect Tapback like
shot double-tap-menu card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
tap Tapback like
expect Remove your reaction, like
doubletap Perfect, see you there
tap Tapback love
expect Remove your reaction, love
# His own chip takes it off with a tap (no list since 0.8.14).
tap Remove your reaction, love
absent Remove your reaction, love
absent People who reacted
shot reaction-removed
swipefrom Perfect, see you there 0.26 0 500
expect Replying
shot swipe-reply card=messages-parity-gesture-reply
tap "Don't reply to this"
absent Replying
# Short reply drag cancels instead of quoting.
swipefrom Perfect, see you there 0.06 0 450
absent Replying
# Left drag returns on release; host probe captures the held timestamps.
swipefrom Perfect, see you there -0.22 0 450
expect Perfect, see you there
# Send appears at once and echo is still one row after the motion.
tap Message
type PARITY-GROUP2-SEND
key ENTER
wait 3500
expect Demo reply to: PARITY-GROUP2-SEND
shot send-settled card=messages-parity-send-motion
key BACK
# A short blank-area right drag cancels back; a full one commits.
swipe 0.5 0.25 0.59 0.25 500
expect Perfect, see you there
swipe 0.5 0.25 0.98 0.25 600
expect Messages
absent Perfect, see you there
expect Muted
shot back-to-list
# List left-swipe reveals the same accessible actions.
swipefrom Ana Demo -0.4 0 500
expect Unpin
expect Unmute
shot list-swipe card=messages-parity-chat-actions
tap Unpin
expect Muted
shot unpinned-muted card=messages-parity-pinned-muted
# Opening another row closes the earlier reveal.
swipefrom Ana Demo -0.4 0 500
expect Unmute conversation Ana Demo
swipefrom Weekend -0.4 0 500
expect Mute conversation Weekend
absent Unmute conversation Ana Demo
shot one-row-open card=messages-parity-chat-actions
